  "description": "F# port of meshoptimizer — a library for optimizing triangle meshes for GPU rendering. Includes vertex cache and fetch optimization, overdraw optimization, mesh simplification (QEM), index/vertex buffer encoding, meshlet building, spatial sorting, triangle stripification, and quantization. Line-by-line translation of the C/C++ source with SIMD support (SSE4.1/NEON with scalar fallback). No external dependencies.",
